s/105710","id":2830310748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6osx1c","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T12:36:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T12:36:17Z","body":"I've ended up testing a different solution that just renames `size()` to `buffer_size` and continues to use that for cases where it is unclear to me how the surrounding code makes use of it.\r\nIt ended up being a lot less risky and still solves the problem. We can probably get rid of more `buffer_size` uses passively as the code is being churned.\r\n\r\nI'll mark this PR as draft and create the other PR once it compiles on all platforms.\r\nI think it's the better solution to the problem at hand.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2830310748/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]